{"src":"en","tgt":"de","rate":24000,"room_opened_ms_before":1500,"err":"","clip_ms":164500,"events":[{"kind":"hello","type":"hello","lang":"de","src":"en","rate":24000,"mode":"utterance","edition":"nonprofit","context":true},{"kind":"input","t":6177.905507,"text":"But after losing the captain's wicket, India only made 36 runs, losing seven was a big"},{"kind":"text","t":6641.797362,"text":"Aber nach dem Verlust des Kapitäns erzielte Indien nur 36 Runs – sieben Verluste waren eine große Belastung."},{"kind":"audio","t":7264.976032,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":7266.4529919999995,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":7267.636455999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":7269.411201,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":7270.883500999999,"samples":28866,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1110},{"kind":"input","t":12756.926755,"text":"They usually have special food, drink, and entertainment offers to keep guests in a good mood and to keep them at the premise."},{"kind":"text","t":13357.514591,"text":"Sie bieten in der Regel spezielle Angebote an Essen, Getränken und Unterhaltung, um die Gäste gut gelaunt zu halten und sie auf dem Gelände zu behalten."},{"kind":"audio","t":14113.440292,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":220,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":14115.206956999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":14117.163107,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":14119.017464,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":14120.985723000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":14123.002774,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":14123.123866999998,"samples":1225,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":19240.709705999998,"text":"Del Potro has the early advantage in the second set, but this is too required a tie break after"},{"kind":"text","t":19664.471363,"text":"Del Potro hat im zweiten Satz einen frühen Vorteil, doch danach ist ein Tiebreak unvermeidlich."},{"kind":"audio","t":20160.712089,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":20162.136528,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":20163.7591,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":20165.289471,"samples":31541,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1260},{"kind":"input","t":25308.007206,"text":"The internet combines elements of both mass and interpersonal communication."},{"kind":"text","t":25634.979235,"text":"Das Internet vereint Elemente der Massenkommunikation und der zwischenmenschlichen Kommunikation."},{"kind":"audio","t":26086.43005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":26087.756866,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":26089.487551,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":26090.244626,"samples":18445,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":650},{"kind":"input","t":34442.501776,"text":"The composition of these crystals matches those found in urine of affected pets when compared by infrared spectroscopy."},{"kind":"text","t":35117.855815999996,"text":"Die Zusammensetzung dieser Kristalle entspricht der in der Urin von betroffenen Tieren nach Vergleich mittels Infrarot-Spektroskopie festgestellten Zusammensetzung."},{"kind":"audio","t":35913.342212999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":280,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":35914.67875,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":35916.285132,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":35917.878813999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":35919.517497,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":35921.083459,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":35921.683351,"samples":13764,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":400},{"kind":"input","t":36884.470693999996,"text":"F-T-I-R."},{"kind":"text","t":36986.912176,"text":"F-T-I-R."},{"kind":"audio","t":37083.178063,"samples":20619,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":750},{"kind":"input","t":42290.58385,"text":"on some routes the larger companies have their own planes but for other routes and smaller firms there was a"},{"kind":"text","t":42823.023934,"text":"Auf einigen Strecken verfügen die größeren Unternehmen über eigene Flugzeuge, doch auf anderen Strecken sowie bei kleineren Firmen gab es eines."},{"kind":"audio","t":43507.023467,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":43508.384765,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":43510.062058999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1080},{"kind":"audio","t":43511.721672,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":43513.311394,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":43513.893476,"samples":15325,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":480},{"kind":"input","t":49510.628425999996,"text":"Some atoms have unstable nuclei, which means that they tend to break up"},{"kind":"text","t":49916.471532999996,"text":"Einige Atome haben instabile Kerne, was bedeutet, dass sie dazu neigen, auseinanderzubrechen."},{"kind":"audio","t":50432.216791,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":50433.670861,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":50435.300503,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":50436.931316,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":50437.040988,"samples":2396,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":53493.566976,"text":"and break apart with little or no nudging."},{"kind":"text","t":53726.802699,"text":"und zerfallen bei geringer oder keiner Anregung."},{"kind":"audio","t":53973.34253,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":53974.356991,"samples":28811,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1070},{"kind":"input","t":60641.599114,"text":"The same month saw another airliner overrun a runway at Moshland and strike a wall killing 17."},{"kind":"text","t":61356.028249999996,"text":"Im selben Monat kollidierte ein weiteres Passagierflugzeug auf dem Flughafen Moshland mit der Startbahn und prallte gegen eine Wand, wodurch 17 Menschen ums Leben kamen."},{"kind":"audio","t":62215.022466,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":70,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":62216.448854,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":62218.055056,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":62219.71221,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":62221.310912,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":62222.900884,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":62224.455995,"samples":29368,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1160},{"kind":"input","t":67216.322545,"text":"They are almost all sandy beaches with safe swimming and most have shade provided by"},{"kind":"text","t":67636.305726,"text":"Es handelt sich fast ausschließlich um sandige Strände mit sicheren Schwimmbedingungen, und die meisten bieten Schatten durch"},{"kind":"audio","t":68172.07596700001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":68173.554757,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":68175.157089,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1260},{"kind":"audio","t":68176.859823,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":160,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":68177.096428,"samples":8247,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":260},{"kind":"input","t":70274.55027400001,"text":"Pohican trees."},{"kind":"text","t":70401.92712800001,"text":"Pohican-Bäume."},{"kind":"audio","t":70522.419892,"samples":27306,"rate":24000,"on":230,"off":1060},{"kind":"input","t":76425.62466,"text":"Popular sports include football, basketball, volleyball, water polo, fencing, rugby,"},{"kind":"text","t":76800.24943800001,"text":"Zu den beliebten Sportarten gehören Fußball, Basketball, Volleyball, Wasserball, Fechten und Rugby."},{"kind":"audio","t":77357.27249700001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":77358.737907,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":77360.35737900001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":70,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":77361.987112,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":77362.550703,"samples":13820,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":370},{"kind":"input","t":80701.33367800001,"text":"cycling, ice hockey, roller hockey, and F1."},{"kind":"text","t":80958.490583,"text":"Radfahren, Eishockey, Rollhockey und Formel 1."},{"kind":"audio","t":81289.07621500001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":80,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":81290.58690600001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":81291.468183,"samples":19448,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":690},{"kind":"input","t":86513.60087600001,"text":"In the warm climate of the Middle East, the house was not so important."},{"kind":"text","t":86786.682211,"text":"Im warmen Klima des Nahen Ostens war das Haus nicht so wichtig."},{"kind":"audio","t":87114.478157,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":87115.964557,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":87116.799774,"samples":18055,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":640},{"kind":"input","t":93192.84421000001,"text":"The lake lies 120 kilometers north of Peninsula."},{"kind":"text","t":93464.103338,"text":"Der See liegt 120 Kilometer nördlich der Halbinsel."},{"kind":"audio","t":93823.756055,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":93825.274206,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":93826.558002,"samples":27529,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1040},{"kind":"input","t":98324.411181,"text":"The cabbage juice changes color depending on how acidic, basic, alkaline the chemical is."},{"kind":"text","t":98756.63417800001,"text":"Der Kohlsaft ändert seine Farbe je nachdem, wie sauer, basisch oder alkalisch die Substanz ist."},{"kind":"audio","t":99243.127898,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":99244.73808000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":99246.20298,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":99247.739661,"samples":30427,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1150},{"kind":"input","t":105742.466973,"text":"The bridge is scheduled to be fully operational in September 2017 when the Brazilian custom checkpoints are expected to be finished."},{"kind":"text","t":106386.466702,"text":"Die Brücke soll im September 2017 vollständig in Betrieb genommen werden, sobald voraussichtlich die brasilianischen Zollkontrollpunkte fertiggestellt sind."},{"kind":"audio","t":107187.44442,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":107188.88919900001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":107190.513552,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":107192.171595,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1310},{"kind":"audio","t":107193.829629,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":107195.53857300001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":107195.967571,"samples":12092,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":350},{"kind":"input","t":113143.76531700001,"text":"The moisture on your hands will react with the outer layers, which will feel funny and form a sort of shell."},{"kind":"text","t":113736.41679300001,"text":"Die Feuchtigkeit in Ihren Händen reagiert mit den äußeren Schichten, wodurch sich ein seltsames Gefühl ergibt und eine Art Schale entsteht."},{"kind":"audio","t":114361.73648600001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114363.084023,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114364.65122500001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114366.358359,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1300},{"kind":"audio","t":114368.150745,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1120},{"kind":"audio","t":114368.27598800001,"samples":278,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":119599.31616,"text":"One bomb exploded outside the Governor's General's office."},{"kind":"text","t":119860.126029,"text":"Eine Bombe explodierte vor dem Büro des Generalgouverneurs."},{"kind":"audio","t":120163.35824,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":120164.923232,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":120165.246668,"samples":10811,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":300},{"kind":"input","t":125307.217458,"text":"The Moroccan Sultan rebuilt the city as Daru i Bayt"},{"kind":"text","t":125591.667312,"text":"Der marokkanische Sultan baute die Stadt als Daru i Bayt wieder auf."},{"kind":"audio","t":125970.178379,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":290,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":125971.642538,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":125973.259791,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1250},{"kind":"audio","t":125973.360753,"samples":334,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":130423.615443,"text":"and it was given the name Casablanca by Spanish traders who established trading bases."},{"kind":"text","t":130856.02028400001,"text":"Und sie erhielt den Namen Casablanca von spanischen Händlern, die Handelsstützpunkte errichteten."},{"kind":"audio","t":131333.279588,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":290,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":131334.81956899998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":131336.793549,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":131337.951622,"samples":24297,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":880},{"kind":"input","t":142815.644542,"text":"He was greeted by Singapore's Deputy Prime Minister Wong Kan-seng and discussed trade and terrorism issues with the Singapore Prime Minister Lee Hsien Long."},{"kind":"text","t":143555.275146,"text":"Er wurde vom stellvertretenden Premierminister Singapurs, Wong Kan-seng, begrüßt und sprach mit dem Premierminister Singapurs, Lee Hsien Long, über Themen der Handel und des Terrorismus."},{"kind":"audio","t":144535.556832,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":144537.047872,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":144538.747736,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1250},{"kind":"audio","t":144540.43751,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":144542.12030399998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":144543.835988,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":144545.53501199998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1250},{"kind":"audio","t":144546.720676,"samples":24185,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":900},{"kind":"input","t":154253.34505899998,"text":"The fission bomb works on the principle that it takes energy to put together a nucleus with many protons and neutrons."},{"kind":"text","t":154808.731755,"text":"Die Spaltungsbombe funktioniert nach dem Prinzip, dass Energie benötigt wird, um einen Kern mit vielen Protonen und Neutronen zusammenzubilden."},{"kind":"audio","t":155532.0506,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":280,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":155533.558811,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1300},{"kind":"audio","t":155535.200904,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":110,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":155536.806736,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":155538.36978799998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":155539.593642,"samples":24241,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":880},{"kind":"input","t":162811.774659,"text":"In the archipelago and lakes you do not necessarily need a yacht"},{"kind":"text","t":163102.369466,"text":"Auf den Inseln und in den Seen braucht man nicht unbedingt ein Boot."},{"kind":"audio","t":163423.172642,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":163424.68461199998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":163425.358806,"samples":16105,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":550},{"kind":"close","t":174601.801785,"code":1005}]}